K = {student_id, module_code, semester}. K+ starts with those three attributes. student_id adds student_name and programme; module_code adds module_title and lecturer_id; lecturer_id adds lecturer_name; the full K adds grade. Therefore K+ is the whole relation and no proper subset determines grade.

