 UPDATE product SET stock_qty=stock_qty-q WHERE product_id=p;
 RETURN id;
END; $$ LANGUAGE plpgsql;

All statements execute together and errors rollback. The lock prevents lost stock updates. Constraints should also check quantity and discount. WAL handles durability. Missing product handling is not clearly included because st will be null.

